    "description": "The Streaming Subscriptions Downgrade API allows businesses to manage their subscription tiers by enabling the downgrade of existing streaming subscriptions. This operation primarily focuses on adjusting subscription plans to better align with user needs or budget limitations. Typical consumers of this API include developers of billing systems and user account management applications seeking to enhance customer experience through flexible subscription management. By utilizing this API, users can effectively reduce their subscription costs while maintaining necessary access to streaming services.",
